<title>BRAZIL: Brazil Telesp Jan-May net 331 mln reais.</title>
<headline>Brazil Telesp Jan-May net 331 mln reais.</headline>
<dateline>SAO PAULO 1996-07-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Brazilian federal telecommunications company Telesp, a unit of the federal Telebras system, on Wednesday released the following preliminary consolidated financial results for the January-May period.</p>
<p>				Jan-May 1997</p>
<p> Net			 331.466 million</p>
<p> Holding net	     367.607 million</p>
<p>    Gross revenues	  2.446 bln</p>
<p>Net operating revenue 1.826 bln</p>
<p>    Operating profit	518.658 million</p>
<p>    Pretax profit	   521.927 million</p>
<p>Note: figures in Brazilian reais, not adjusted for inflation.</p>
<p>The company said in a statement its net worth totaled 9.684 bln reais in the January-May period.</p>
<p>It also said consolidated installed fixed lines reached 5.48 million while cellular terminals totaled 869,000 in the period.</p>
<p>(( -- Sao Paulo newsroom, 5511 248 5410))</p>
</text>
